        <mxCell id="exp" value="&lt;h3&gt;UWeaponAttachmentComponent - Explanation&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Role&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Owns and queries the attachments of one weapon (sight, grip, stock, laser).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;GetTotalModifiers()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Sums the modifiers of every attachment (damage, recoil, spread). The weapon applies them once during initialization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;GetGripSocketTransform()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Used for left-hand IK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;GetAttachmentMesh()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: The ViewModel asks for the sight mesh to align the camera for aiming down sights.&lt;/p&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fffdf2;strokeColor=#d6b656;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
